Question catalog
----------------
The questions, answer options and pictures in app/src/main/assets/ are taken
from the official catalog of test questions, published as Anlage 1 of the
Verordnung zu Einbürgerungstest und Einbürgerungskurs (Einbürgerungstest-
verordnung, EinbTestV, BGBl. I 2008 S. 1649, as amended) and provided by the
Bundesamt für Migration und Flüchtlinge (BAMF) at
https://oet.bamf.de/ords/oetut/f?p=534:1::::::

As part of a German federal regulation, the catalog is an official work
without copyright protection under § 5 (1) of the German Copyright Act (UrhG).
Its text has been transcribed with OCR and corrected by hand; the pictures
have been cropped from the portal's question images.

This app is not affiliated with or endorsed by the BAMF or any other
government agency. The English, Ukrainian and Turkish translations are learning
aids created for this project; only the German text is authoritative.

